<Layout title="About | Greenville IT Solutions" description="Meet Greenville, a practical web and mobile development partner based in Juja, Kenya.">
	<main><section class="hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">About Greenville</div><h1>A small studio for <em>useful software.</em></h1><p class="hero-copy">Greenville is based in Juja, Kenya. We work with businesses, schools, and organizations that need a capable website, web platform, or Android app.</p></div></section><section class="page-content"><div class="container split-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Our point of view</div><h2>Start with the person doing the work.</h2></div><div class="copy"><p>Before we discuss features, we want to know what people are trying to do, what gets in their way, and what a better day would look like.</p><p>That usually leads to a smaller, more focused product. It also gives your team something they can keep improving after launch.</p></div></div></section><section class="soft-section"><div class="container split-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">How projects run</div><h2>A simple process, with room for questions.</h2></div><div class="copy"><p><strong>Understand.</strong> We learn the context and agree on the first problem to solve.</p><p><strong>Plan.</strong> We map the screens, scope, and technical route.</p><p><strong>Build.</strong> You see working progress and give feedback along the way.</p><p><strong>Improve.</strong> We fix what needs fixing and plan the next useful release.</p></div></div></section><section class="cta-band"><div class="container cta-row"><h2>Have something in mind?</h2><a class="button button-dark" href="/contact/">Start with a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section></main>
</Layout>